three inexhaustible sources of light in the game. Other two being
Sunsword and the Eyes of the Overworld. However, Sunsword is crap
and has to be wielded to work. And Eyes can blast a low-level char
into oblivion :-)

Anyway, if you insist on spending this wish - wish for the Eyes.
If you survive the blast it's a good trade (you also get the MR).
If you don't want to break artiwishless, really, just save it
for an emergency. And if you reach those later, darkish level,
or, god bless, Gehennom, you'll find a permanent light source
*well* worth a wish. Especially because once you've generated enough
artifacts it becomes unwishable - magic lamps can't be wished for,
and chances of getting an artifact from a wish are very slim late
in the game.

